[27.836743, "o", "# pgvector\r\n\r\n"]
[27.836773, "o", "pgvector is a PostgreSQL extension for vector similarity search. It adds the\r\n`vector` data type and distance operators: `<->` (Euclidean), `<#>` (negative\r\ninner product) and `<=>` (cosine distance).\r\n"]
