[122.294237, "o", "\r\nCloudNativePG creates three services for applications:\r\n\r\n1. `-rw` (primary only)\r\n2. `-ro` (replicas only)\r\n3. `-r` (any instance)\r\n\r\nSources:\r\n  [1] demo-app/sample-data/cloudnative-pg.md#0  (similarity 0.797)\r\n  [2] demo-app/sample-data/llm-d.md#0  (similarity 0.496)\r\n  [3] demo-app/sample-data/pgvector.md#0  (similarity 0.493)\r\n  [4] sql:faq-1#0  (similarity 0.486)\r\n  [5] sql:faq-2#0  (similarity 0.450)\r\n"]
